<title>JAPAN: Nissan says dlr level of 120 yen &quot;appropriate&quot;.</title>
<headline>Nissan says dlr level of 120 yen &quot;appropriate&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>An exchange rate of 120 yen to the dollar was the &quot;appropriate&quot; level for Nissan's business, Nissan Motor president Yoshikazu Hanawa told reporters on Friday.</p>
</text>
